  {"cle":"landing.voix.bienvenue","ecran":"landing","contexte":"Annonce automatique — Page de présentation","texte_fr":"Bienvenue sur SatsPoint, la caisse qui encaisse tout : bitcoin, Wave, Orange Money et Free Money. Touchez un haut-parleur pour écouter.","texte_en":"Welcome to SatsPoint, the checkout that accepts everything: bitcoin, Wave, Orange Money and Free Money. Tap a speaker to listen.","essentielle":true},
  {"cle":"landing.hero.texte","ecran":"landing","contexte":"Texte lu — Page de présentation","texte_fr":"Fixez vos prix en FCFA. Vos clients paient en bitcoin, Wave, Orange Money ou Free Money. L'argent arrive en quelques secondes, directement chez vous.","texte_en":"Set your prices in CFA francs. Your customers pay with bitcoin, Wave, Orange Money or Free Money. The money lands in seconds, straight to you.","essentielle":true},
